"price":499.95,"scene":"Vintage","tones":["#dad1c4","#885d3f"],"ar":0.75,"img":"https://github.com/pliggity/vignette/releases/download/images/img-1785728496436-z0xqdje2d0d.jpg","span":2,"photo":"add a photo","owned":false,"tagIds":[],"notes":"Used (normal wear), Product Details\n\n100% Fully Authenticated Stickley Build: Hot-stamped directly into the under-frame timber with the Fayetteville, NY maker's mark and its exact 1979 birth date.\n\nPremium Solid Cherry Hardwood: Bench-made using solid native timber throughout—absolutely zero veneers, particle boards, or compromised cores.\n\nTurnkey 7-Piece Entertaining Layout: Includes the substantial cabriole-leg extension table, 2 host armchairs, and 4 high-back side chairs.\n\n\nTable 96\"L x 45\"w x 30\"H Chair 20\"L x 18\"w x 38\",H Captains chairs 25\"L x 18\"w x 38\"H \n\nAnchor your formal dining room or historic home layout with the undisputed gold standard of American craftsmanship. Hand-detailed by the legendary artisans at L. & J.G. Stickley in Fayetteville, New York, this exceptional 7-piece formal dining set is an investment-grade masterpiece. Fully authenticated by its original factory hot-stamps, this exact collection was completed on July 25, 1979, showcasing over four decades of unmatched structural integrity and deep, natural wood-grain maturation.Crafted entirely from heavy-gauge, premium solid native cherry wood, the central extension table features a gorgeous book-matched top field supported by graceful Queen Anne cabriole legs with classic pad feet. The set comes beautifully complete with six matching solid cherry high-back chairs, consisting of two commanding host armchairs with sweeping ergonomic arm rests and four side chairs. Every chair features an elegant, contoured center splat and is fitted with a clean drop-in seat deck wrapped in a traditional earth-toned striped textile.. Make an offer!;","url":"https://offerup.co/CXkPgQHci5b"},{"id":112,"name":"Vintage Wooden 6-Tier Display Cabinet | Habi